import Verify.Basic
import Verify.Tactic
import Verify.Eval.Common.Measure

/-!
# Lane A fixture: Shared family, n = 16 ops

Generated by scripts/eval/fixtures/gen_solm.py; do not edit by hand.

One expression `(x + 1) * (x + 2) + x * 3` of `x = s 0` stored into slots 1..15; the postcondition repeats it 15 times (one shared subterm, used many times).

